<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><title>Two Opposing Risks | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis</title><meta name="title" content="Two Opposing Risks | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="description" content=""/><meta name="content centers" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:pagetype" content="Article"/><meta name="ess:parenttopic" content="Policy"/><meta name="ess:contentcenter" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:publishdatetime" content="2022-01-04T06:00:00Z"/><meta name="sortDate" content="2022-01-04T06:00:00Z"/><meta name="relative-publish-dates" content="Past 10 Years"/><meta name="relative-publish-dates" content="Past 5 Years"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="/article/2022/two-opposing-risks"/><meta property="og:title" content="Two Opposing Risks | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="og:description" content=""/><meta property="og:image" content="/-/media/assets/articles/2022/two-opposing-risks/two-opposing-risks-key.jpg?rev=98229063cf944f2ebb07c2702dad57ce"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Two Opposing Risks | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="twitter:description" content=""/><meta name="twitter:url" content="/article/2022/two-opposing-risks"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="/-/media/assets/articles/2022/two-opposing-risks/two-opposing-risks-key.jpg?rev=98229063cf944f2ebb07c2702dad57ce?sc_lang=en"/><meta name="next-head-count" content="24"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ba589f78dbc8687a-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5f5027ccbe3e5871-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="s